     H*****************************************************************
     H*****************************************************************
     H*    PROGRAM: F0070R                                            *
     H*    DESCRIPTION: FEE SCHEDULE ENTRY/ADJUDICATION               *
     H*****************************************************************
     H*     ********  P R O G R A M M E R  N O T E **********         *
     H*                                                               *
     H* WHEN COMPILING THE DISPLAY FILE (F0070F) IT MUST ALWAYS BE    *
     H* COMPILED WITH THE FOLLOWING OPTIONS:                          *
     H*      ENHDSP *NO                                               *
     H*      DFRWRT *NO                                               *
     H* IF THE DISPLAY IS NOT COMPILED WITH THESE TWO OPTIONS, THERE  *
     H* WILL BE PROBLEMS WITH THE DISPLAY FILE PROCESSING.            *
     H*****************************************************************
     H**                                                             **
     H**    IMPORTANT NOTE !!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!  **
     H**                                                             **
     H**    IF A FIELD IS ADDED OR DELETED FROM F0091F OR F0092F     **
     H**    THE FOLLOWING PROGRAMS MUST BE RECOMPILED:               **
     H**                                                             **
     H**    F0090R,  F0091R,   F0092R,  F0070R                       **
     H**                                                             **
     H*****************************************************************
     H* Possible Changes for Specific States:
     H*
     H*   "P" type bill:
     H*   --------------
     H*
     H*             Condition                                 Code Type
     H*             ============================================================
     H*         a.  FMPRP Anes Amount NE 0 and Scrn Units > 0 (Anes code)
     H*     OR  b.  FMPRP Anes Flag = Y and Scrn Units > 0    (Surg code w/Anes)
     H*     OR  c.  FMPRP Anes Flag = B and Scrn Units > 0    (Anes/Rnt is BR)
     H*     OR  d.  Scrn PMOD = '30' and Scrn Units > 0       (Anes Modifier)
     H*     OR  e.  FMPRP Anes Flag = M and Scrn Units > 0    (Mileage)
     H*     OR  f.  FMPRP Anes Flag = H and Scrn Units > 0    (Hours)
     H*     OR  g.  FMPRP Anes Flag = R and Scrn Units > 0    (Rental)
     H*     OR  h.  FMPRP Anes Flag = I and Scrn Units > 0    (Rental I.C.)
     H*     OR  i.  FMRCP Anes Amt NE 0 and State eq OH       (Anes code)
     H*
     H*     NOTE:  If you make any changes to these conditions, you must update
     H*            the program in 2 places:  at SCR05T tag and in WRIT2 subr
     H*
     H*   "H" type bill:
     H*   --------------
     H*   1.  SCR04 COLUMN HEADINGS FOR "SERVICE CODE" FIELDS:
     H*       a.  Update # of records in HD5 (compile-time array)
     H*       b.  Specify which heading (array element) to use based on Adj St
     H*
     H*   2.  UNITS - will divide if:
     H*             Condition
     H*             ============================================================
     H*         a.  STSTP/ST1A1 = Y    (Based on State Code - divide units)
     H*
     H*     NOTE:  If you make any changes to these conditions, you must update
     H*            the program in 2 places:  at SCR05T tag and in WRIT4 subr
     H*****************************************************************
     H*  Adjudication Types:
     H*       P = PBR/Provider Bill Review (normal HCFA-1500)
     H*             Used for all states
     H*       H = HBA/Hospital Bill Audit (normal UB82/UB92)
     H*             Used for all states (who have HBA)
     H*       A = Ambulatory Surgical Center (SPCD = ASC)
     H*             Used for AL, FL
     H*       D = Dental Bill
     H*             Used for all states (who have Dental)
     H*       I = Diagnostic Center
     H*             Used for AL
     H*****************************************************************
     H*  MODIFICATIONS FOR TAPE SUBMISSION SYSTEM:                    *
     H*  1.  CHG FILES:  NONE                                         *
     H*  2.  ADD FILES:  FMDIL (PDI01)                                *
     H*                  FADCL (PDC01)                                *
     H*                  FDCALD(PCA0D)                                *
     H*  3.  CHG SCRNS:  SCR01:  ADD PROV/MOD/PRTY                    *
     H*                          ADD CMD 11 - PROVIDER SEARCH         *
     H*                  SCR02:  CHG ORDER OF CLM STS/PROV/MOD TO     *
     H*                                       PROV/MOD/CLM STS        *
     H*                          ADD SCDIA (1-4) FIELDS               *
     H*                          ADD SCDX  (1-10) FIELDS              *
     H*                          ADD ERR MSG 1, ERR MSG 2             *
     H*  4.  ADD CMD KEYS: SCR01: CMD 11 - PROVIDER SEARCH            *
     H*  5.  CHG PROCESSING:  EDIT2 SUBROUTINE - CHECK FOR FADCP RCD  *
     H*                       WRIT2 SUBROUTINE - CADXR/CADCS#         *
     H*  6.  ADD PROCESSING:  DCSR SUBROUTINE                         *
     H*                       DCSR2 SUBROUTINE                        *
     H*****************************************************************
     H*  MODIFICATIONS FOR PEND LETTER SYSTEM:                        *
     H*  1.  CHG FILES:  FDCALB(PCA0B) TO FDCALF(PCA0F)               *
     H*  2.  ADD FILES:  FALTL (PLT01)                                *
     H*                  FALTL1(PLT02)                                *
     H*                  FDCALG(PCA0G)                                *
     H*                  FDCALI(PCA0I)                                *
     H*  3.  ADD CMD KEYS: SCR02: CMD 18 - TO PEND                    *
     H*                           CMD 19 - REQUEST LETTER SEARCH      *
     H*                           CMD 20 - TO UNPEND                  *
     H*                           CMD 21 - PENDED CHARGES SEARCH      *
     H*  4.  INFO MSG DISPLAYS IF CASE/PROVIDER ENTERED HAS ACTIVE    *
     H*      PEND LETTERS (SEE PNDSR)                                 *
     H*****************************************************************
