     H*** 01/21/91 *** LJD ********************************************
     H*  REVISED WRIT2 SUBROUTINE: USER MAY NOW ENTER 1 DETAIL LINE   *
     H*    WITH THE TOTAL NUMBER OF UNITS, AND TOTAL CHARGE FOR ALL   *
     H*    UNITS. PGM WILL WRITE TO THE FILE 1 RECORD FOR EACH UNIT   *
     H*    WITH THE SAME SERVICE DATE, PLACE OF SERVICE, CODE, MOD,   *
     H*    DC XREF AND BODY PART.  CHARGE WILL BE DETERMINED BY       *
     H*    TOTAL CHARGE/UNITS = SINGLE UNIT CHARGE.  ANESTHESIA CODES *
     H*    WILL NOT BE AFFECTED BY THE ABOVE CHANGE.                  *
     H*    NOTE:  RECORDS WITH THE SAME DATE/TIME STAMP WILL INDICATE *
     H*           A MULTIPLE UNIT RECORD THAT HAS BEEN DIVIDED        *
     H*** 02/13/91 *** LJD ********************************************
