     H*     PHYSICIAN BILLS.  THIS WORKS IN THIS INSTANCE BECAUSE    **
     H*     WE ARE ALWAYS LOOKING FOR FSMRA, AND THIS WILL BE IN THE **
     H*     SAME FIELD REGARDLESS OF WHETHER WE USED THE FULL SERVICE**
     H*     CODE OR JUST THE PART OF THE KEY WE ARE USING            **
     H*                                                              **
     H*                 1. Added new programming to process          **
     H*                    the FS MRA vs. Payment Difference         **
     H*                    calculations:                             **
     H*                    a.  Prior to call to ADJPGM (done in F17, **
     H*                        SCR03/Change and SCR03/Delete)        **
     H*                        to read FDCAP to get/delete FSMRA record
     H*                    b.  Upon return from ADJPGM, execute CRTDIF*
     H*                        to read FDCAP to determine:           **
     H*                        TOTAL CHARGED - TOTAL PAID = BALANCE  **
     H*                        TOTAL FS vs. PAYMENT DIFFERENCE       **
     H*                    c.  If FS/PAYMENT DIFFERENCE is greater   **
     H*                        than or equal to the BALANCE then     **
     H*                        BALANCE = ADDTL REIMBURSEMENT         **
     H*                        Else if FS/PAYMENT DIFFERENCE is less **
     H*                        than the BALANCE then                 **
     H*                        FS/PAYMENT DIFF = ADDTL REIMBURSEMENT **
     H*                    d.  An ADDTL REIMBURSEMENT ("FSMRA")      **
     H*                        record is written to FDCAP            **
     H*                    e.  "FSMRA" amount record only written if **
     H*                        greater than zero                     **
     H*                    f.  "FSMRA" amount is not included in     **
     H*                        TOTAL CHARGE field displayed on SCR03 **
     H*                        line item nor in parm passed to F0086R**
     H*                                                              **
