     C*** BEGIN CHG *** 10/03/97 **************************************
      *   THIS FIELD IS NOT USED ANY WHERE ELSE IN THE PROGRAM.
      *   IT IS USED TO VERIFY THAT THE OVERIDES HAVE BEEN SET TO THE
      *   STATE.  PRIOR TO THIS CHANGE, THE USER WAS ABLE TO ENTER ONE
      *   BILL.  IF THEY DIDN'T EXIT AND WENT THROUGH AGAIN, QQENTER
      *   WAS EQUAL TO 2 AND XXAST EQ QQAST SO THE OVERIDE WAS NOT DONE
      *   BUT WHEN THE BILL ENTRY PROCESS WAS COMPLETED THE OVERIDE WAS
      *   DELETED.
