     C*
     C* ADJUDICATE THE BILL
     C*
     C                   EXSR      EDIT4
     C*** BEGIN ADD *** 07/22/97 **************************************
     C* ===============================================================
     C* MORE THAN ONE DATE OF SERVICE MUST BE ENTERED IF INPATIENT
     C****
     C*****                MOVE *OFF      *IN17
     C*** BEGIN DEL *** 11/12/97 **************************************
     C****       CHGFLG    IFNE 'Y'                        NO CURRENT
     C*****                                                CHARGES
     C****                 MOVEL'BLTY'    KYTBID    P
     C****                 MOVELSCBTYP    KYKEY     P
     C****       GTKY      CHAINPGT01                60
     C****       *IN60     IFEQ '0'
     C****                 MOVE GTFG01    XTFG01  1
     C****       XTFG01    IFEQ 'I'
     C****                 Z-ADD0         COUNT   20
     C****                 Z-ADD0         ZZRRN   50
     C****                 DO   20        ZZRRN
     C****       ZZRRN     CHAINSCR04S               60
     C****       *IN60     IFEQ *OFF
     C****       SCSVDT    IFNE *ZEROS
     C****       COUNT     ADD  1         COUNT
     C****                 ENDIF                           SCSVDT IFNE
     C****                 ENDIF                           *IN60 IFEQ
     C****                 ENDDO
     C****       COUNT     IFLT 2
     C****                 MOVE '1'       *IN17
     C****                 GOTO STRT
     C****                 ELSE
     C****                 MOVE '0'       *IN17
     C****                 ENDIF                           COUNT IFLT
     C****                 ENDIF                           XTFG01 IFEQC
     C****                 ENDIF                           *IN60 IFEQ
     C****                 ENDIF                           *IN94 IFEQ
     C****
     C*** END   DEL *** 11/12/97 **************************************
     C*** END ADD *** 07/22/97 ****************************************
     C*
     C                   MOVE      *BLANKS       TABKEY
     C                   MOVEL     SCCSCD        TABKEY
     C     TCSKY         CHAIN     PCS01                              60
     C     *IN60         IFEQ      '0'
     C*** BEG DEL *** 02/14/97 ***
     C******************   EXCPTRCS01
     C*** END DEL *** 02/14/97 ***
     C                   END
     C     CSDISC        IFNE      'P'
     C*
     C                   EXSR      WRIT4
