     C                   MOVE      *BLANKS       Q2RECF
     C                   MOVEL     'SCR04'       Q2RECF
     C                   GOTO      STRT
     C                   END                                                    END EQ 'P'
     C*
     C                   Z-ADD     *ZEROS        K
