     C*
     C*** END ADD ***** 12/15/97 *************************************
     C*
     C                   MOVE      '0'           *IN37
      *** BEG ADD *** 06/29/98 ****************************************
     C                   MOVE      *BLANK        QQRTCD
      *** END ADD *** 06/29/98 ****************************************
     C                   CALL      ADJPGM                                 37     * ERROR *
     C                   PARM                    XXFYR
     C                   PARM                    SCCASE
     C                   PARM                    QQFDTS                         (5 DATES)
     C                   PARM                    QQFDT2
     C*** BEG CHG *** 09/24/99 ****************************************
