     C                   MOVE      QQER#S        QZER#S           60
     C                   MOVE      QQSQPC        QZSQPC          250
     C                   MOVE      QQERPC        QZERPC          250
     C                   MOVE      *BLANKS       QZSQMD          250
     C                   MOVE      *BLANKS       QZERMD          250
     C                   MOVE      *BLANKS       QZSQCR          250
     C                   MOVE      *BLANKS       QZERCR          250
     C                   CALL      'F0073R'
