     C*****                MOVE *BLANKS   QQPRC2
     C*****                MOVE *BLANKS   QQPRC3
     C*****                MOVE *BLANKS   QQPRC4
     C*****                MOVE *ZEROS    QQADDT
     C*****                MOVE *ZEROS    QQCFRM
     C*****                MOVE *ZEROS    QQCTO
     C*****                MOVE *BLANKS   QQRTCD
     C*****                CALL 'F0156R'
     C*****                PARM           QQPRDS
     C*****                PARM           QQCALL
     C*****                PARM           Q3CO#   3
     C*****                PARM           Q3SUB#  5
     C*****                PARM           Q3FND   3
