     C                   MOVE      SCDIA2        HD2(Z1)
     C                   MOVE      SCDIA3        HD3(Z1)
     C                   MOVE      SCDIA4        HD4(Z1)
     C*
     C                   ADD       1             Z1
     C*
     C                   END
     C*
     C                   XFOOT     HT2           SCTTLC                         DSP TOT CHG
     C*
     C                   ENDSR
     C*** END ADD *** 04/08/93 ****************************************
