     C*
     C                   END
     C                   END
     C     *IN61         CABEQ     '1'           STRT
     C*
     C*** END ADD ***** 06/16/94 *********************************************
     C*
     C* =================================================================== *
     C*
     C* * * IF PRC MOD NOT BLANK THEN MUST BE ON FILE
     C                   MOVEA     '00000000'    *IN(50)
