     C*
     C                   END
     C                   END
     C     *IN35         CABEQ     '1'           STRT
     C*
     C* =================================================================== *
     C*
     C* * * IF PRC CODE NOT ENTERED BUT PRTY = N ERROR (MED PROVIDER)
