     C*
     C* =================================================================== *
     C*
     C* IF PROCEDURE CODE IS IN THE FOLLOWING RANGES, A MODIFIER IS
     C* REQUIRED:  E0000 - E9999, L0000 - L9999
     C* MISSISSIPPI ONLY
     C*
     C     SCAST         IFEQ      'MS'
     C*
     C                   MOVEA     '00000000'    *IN(50)
     C                   MOVEA     '00'          *IN(58)
     C                   MOVE      '0'           *IN09
     C*
