     C* * * SERVICE DATES MUST BE VALID & ON OR AFTER ACCIDENT DATE.
     C**********           MOVEA'00000000'*IN,50
     C**********           MOVEA'00'      *IN,58
     C**********           MOVE '0'       *IN23
     C*
     C**********           DO   10        Y       50
     C********** TC,Y      IFNE *ZERO
     C*
     C*
     C********** Y         ADD  49        Y1      20
     C*
     C**********           MOVE SD,Y      SRDTE   6
     C*
     C**********           CALL 'SRDCK'
     C**********           PARM           SRDTE   6
     C**********           PARM ' '       SRERR   1
     C**********           PARM ' '       SRTERM  1
     C*
     C********** SRERR     IFEQ '1'
