     C********** IO,Y      ANDNE'B'
     C********** IO,Y      ANDNE'C'
     C********** IO,Y      ANDNE'D'
     C********** IO,Y      ANDNE'E'
     C********** IO,Y      ANDNE'F'
     C**********           MOVE *BLANKS   QQPOS
     C**********           MOVE IO,Y      QQPOS
     C**********           MOVE 'V'       QQRTCD
