     C*
     C                   DO        10            Y                 5 0
     C*
     C     Y             ADD       49            Y1                2 0
     C*
     C     T2(Y)         IFEQ      *ZERO                                        TOTAL CHARGES
     C**
     C     SD(Y)         IFNE      *ZEROS                                       FILL DT
     C     RX(Y)         ORNE      *BLANKS                                      RX#
     C     ND(Y)         ORNE      *BLANKS                                      NDC CODE
