     C                   ELSE                                                   ELSE RCANAM GT ZEROS
     C*** BEGIN ADD *** 08/25/97 ****************************************
     C*** IN OHIO REASONABLE AND CUSTOMARY CODES FROM RANGE 7000-99499
     C*** ARE NOT TO BE BROKEN DOWN INTO DIFFERENT LINES
      *
     C     SCAST         IFEQ      'OH'
     C     RCCPT4        ANDGE     '70000'
     C     RCCPT4        ANDLE     '99499'
