     C     CAKYF         SETGT     PCA0F
     C                   READP     PCA0F                                  60
     C  N60              EXCEPT    RLSCAF                                       07/31/90 ADD
     C     *IN60         IFEQ      '0'
     C     CACO#         ANDEQ     SCCO#
     C     CASUB#        ANDEQ     SCSUB#
     C     CAFND         ANDEQ     SCFND
     C     CAFYR         ANDEQ     XXFYR
     C     CACASE        ANDEQ     SCCASE
