     C*********            EXSR CLR
     C*********            Z-ADD04        I1
     C*********  OVERP     TAG
     C*********
     C***BEGINNING OF FILE
     C*********
     C*********  *IN99     IFEQ '1'
     C*********            EXSR LOADB
     C*********            GOTO DONEP
     C*********            END
     C*********
     C***FILL SCREEN AND GET NEXT RECORD
     C*********
     C*********            SUB  1         I1
     C*********            EXSR FILL
     C*********            READPPCA0E                    99
     C**N99                EXCPTRLSCAE
     C**N99      CACO#     COMP UPCO#                9999
     C**N99      CASUB#    COMP UPSUB#               9999
     C**N99      CAFND     COMP UPFND                9999
     C**N99      CAFYR     COMP XXFYR                9999
     C**N99      CACASE    COMP SCCASE               9999
     C***99                DO
     C*********            MOVE '1'       XXDOWN
     C*********            GOTO OVERP
     C*********            END
     C*********  I1        COMP 1                    91
     C***91                GOTO OVERP
     C*********  DONEP     TAG
     C*********            MOVE SQ,1      KEY,1
     C*********            MOVE SQ,3      KEY,2
     C*********  SQ,1      COMP *ZERO                    04
     C*********  SQ,2      COMP *ZERO                    05
     C*********  SQ,3      COMP *ZERO                    06
     C*********
     C*********            MOVEA'000'     *IN,50
     C*********            MOVE SQ,1      XSEQ1   5
     C*********            MOVE SQ,2      XSEQ2   5
     C*********            MOVE SQ,3      XSEQ3   5
     C**N04      XSEQ1     LOKUPQS,1                     50
     C**N05      XSEQ2     LOKUPQS,1                     51
     C**N06      XSEQ3     LOKUPQS,1                     52
     C*********
     C*********
     C*********  *IN50     IFEQ '1'
     C*********  *IN51     OREQ '1'
     C*********  *IN52     OREQ '1'
     C*********            MOVE '1'       *IN29
     C*********            ELSE
     C*********            MOVE '0'       *IN29
     C*********            END
     C*********
     C*********            ENDSR
