     C*****************************************************************
     C* DCSR                                                          *
     C* CHECK FOR ANY OUTSTANDING DIAG CODE RECORD FOR PROVIDER       *
     C* THIS WILL HIGHLIGHT AND PROTECT THE DIAGNOSIS CODES FROM THE  *
     C* PREVIOUS SET OF CHARGES.  AN INFORMATIONAL MESSAGE WILL BE    *
     C* DISPLAYED TELLING THE USER THAT CURRENT CHARGES EXISTS        *
     C* THEREFORE, THEY WILL HAVE TO USE THOSE DIAGNOSIS CODES AND    *
     C* CAN ONLY ENTER ADDITIONAL CODES IF THERE ARE BLANK FIELDS LEFT*
     C*****************************************************************
     C     DCSR          BEGSR
     C*
     C*** BEGIN ADD *** 07/22/97 **************************************
     C                   MOVE      *BLANKS       CHGFLG
     C*** END ADD *** 07/22/97 ****************************************
