     C*****************************************************************
     C* DCSRA                                                         *
     C* THIS SUBROUTINE IS CALLED DURING POST AUDIT OR RECON IF USER  *
     C* WANTS TO ENTER MORE CHARGES ON SCREEN. THE DIAGNOSIS          *
     C* CODES THAT EXIST IN THE EOB RECORD FROM THE FIRST TIME        *
     C* AUDIT PROCESS ARE RETRIEVED AND PROTECTED.                    *
     C*****************************************************************
     C     DCSRA         BEGSR
     C*********
     C*** BEG DEL *** 03/04/97 ***
     C*********            MOVEA'1111'    *IN,01
     C*********            MOVE '1'       *IN94
     C*********  H1RECF    IFEQ 'SCR04'
     C*********            MOVE '1'       *IN21
     C*********            MOVE '1'       *IN57
     C*********            MOVE '1'       *IN58
     C*********            MOVE '1'       *IN59
     C*********            MOVE '1'       *IN64
     C*********            MOVE '1'       *IN80
     C*********            MOVE '1'       *IN89
     C*********            END
     C*********            MOVELMSG,7     SCMSG1
     C*********
     C*********  EOKY      CHAINPEO01                60
     C*********  *IN60     IFEQ '0'
     C*********            MOVELEODIA1    SCDIA1
     C*********            MOVELEODIA2    SCDIA2
     C*********            MOVELEODIA3    SCDIA3
     C*********            MOVELEODIA4    SCDIA4
     C*********            END
     C*********
     C*********            MOVE QQPRC1    SCPRC1
     C*********            MOVE QQPRC2    SCPRC2
     C*********            MOVE QQPRC3    SCPRC3
     C*********            MOVE QQPRC4    SCPRC4
     C*********            MOVE QQPMTH    SCMETH
     C*********            MOVE QQADDT    SCADDT
     C*********            MOVE QQTOS     SCHTOS
     C*********            MOVE QQDHR     SCDHR
     C*********            MOVE QQTOB     SCBTYP
     C*********            MOVE QQCFRM    SCCFDT
     C*********            MOVE QQCTO     SCCTDT
     C*********
     C**MOVE*'0' TO XX1ST SO THE PRE-CERT WINDOW DOES NOT DISPLAY WHEN ADDING
     C**CHARGES TO AN AUDIT/RECON
     C*********
     C*********            MOVE '0'       XX1ST
     C*********
     C*** END DEL *** 03/04/97 ***
     C                   ENDSR
     C*** END ADD *** 07/26/95 *************************************************
