     C                   MOVEL     HLRECF        Q2RECF
     C*
     C                   ELSE
     C                   MOVEL     *BLANKS       Q2RECF
     C                   MOVEL     HLRECF        Q2RECF
     C*** BEG DEL *** 03/04/97 ***
     C********** Q2RECF    IFEQ 'SCR01'
     C**********           WRITESCR01
     C**********           END
     C*** END DEL *** 03/04/97 ***
     C     Q2RECF        IFEQ      'SCR02'
